[{"id":"20694","date":"2026-11-02T21:04:57+00:00","text":"TRUTH NUKE: 🟠 James Lavish exposes why we've been conditioned to think inflation is normal: \"It's so much harder to tell somebody that they've been lied to all their life than it is to just allow them to believe that lie for the rest of their life... They do not want to believe that they've been bamboozled all these years.\" \"Your house isn't worth more. It's just that the dollars that it's denominated in are worth less.\" Source: https://x.com/SimplyBitcoin/status/2117003703680926031","image":"https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/KM4WzxQSgJG81AasWeC94jJ68JWSKShT9xYmaZ9DcFS2GMYyFZOL6WTJDqeh-vFqCg7p3zkeD-i4MJbwMxhCqyx9vYJNCVdHssits8Uouw9s9bmaijxQzAzWRCdw3BmaLuWe_TaZkBgdKrFFQlLhTBqM39nmObX7bFHHCbzircf-40_mQtvg2chx-U70CWh_e1GdexRgYHoc-T_FhgIOpZ4CJgPwQhhsueGfooD7n1k3RBHTkBA0SyODiRHOoFhwkRbt3CrlVGx3uiZj7ZDVD5qPub7nxSQQf96Ann_3BBiW7Q9LKlZoMbSxzeMG6F3GQ6bJxYbJV44Svw03tVhlUw","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"20693","date":"2026-11-02T19:44:57+00:00","text":"BITWISE CIO MATT HOUGAN: 🟠 \"The underlying blockchain wasn't hacked. The assets held in ETFs or in individual users cold storage wallets weren't hacked. This was a traditional cybersecurity hack. It was a human engineering effort.\" \"This has not changed anything about the long term direction of Bitcoin. And in fact, I think in a week you'll see prices have moved beyond this and recovered from this.\" \"At least historically, hacks haven't had a huge impact on the long term trajectory of prices. I expect that to be true here as well.\" Source: https://x.com/SimplyBitcoin/status/2117328209452658957","image":"https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/Pme04wgNW3u6PfJw3AhVgX5E4ubPV5lF6vufw2AwVOUfcbjCPCid4DC_ucDs1TigA9JN1ETQAZVSKM2qQtv66jgsCRK4OtzCrdBcQVuwK9gWaUpYbFNyKvI0TE5eNbhJtEMnNQJQqPds0fJuq8_J3ZUy-_SgRQ_0MaNRiJ0-efmj79y_H88Ncw-ogw18GDbL4Yb56EEWt8_P5Zts0uJw6Ne2CknBlaZHku1T2ERmZpblA7gTH3wqvV9q7RyvA3KUZ5wEYUKGQUSb99yeiLhcGu--Vqc6PNlHbGXHT50jQkclC0aa9MHJuOlRqk7Gj9jW_7Na7JpkzriBOiM